{"id":"493778","name":"桃胶皂角米雪燕羹","author":"莎糖家","authorId":"10897499","desc":"","cover":"images/493778/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"雪燕","amount":"3克"},{"name":"桃胶","amount":"10克"},{"name":"皂角米","amount":"10克"},{"name":"银耳","amount":"1/4朵"},{"name":"红枣","amount":"10个"},{"name":"枸杞","amount":"10克"},{"name":"红糖","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"清水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好材料，桃胶皂角米雪燕银耳提前一天泡好，枸杞和红枣清干净。","img":"images/493778/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"所有材料泡好清干净后，养生壶里加入适量清水。","img":"images/493778/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"银耳撕成小碎块加入。","img":"images/493778/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入皂角米。","img":"images/493778/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入桃胶。","img":"images/493778/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入红枣。","img":"images/493778/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入枸杞。","img":"images/493778/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"根据个人口味加入适量红糖。","img":"images/493778/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"开启燕窝功能。","img":"images/493778/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"定时设置到60分钟。","img":"images/493778/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"煮至中.....","img":"images/493778/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"分钟到了以后加入雪燕，然后再煮10分钟就OK了。","img":"images/493778/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"红糖可以换成冰糖。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：养生壶\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}